      "confidence": 0.6
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The drawing shows at least two connectivity deviations: the servo headers appear to have their ground pin tied to the servo power rail instead of GND, and the two 2x15 bus connectors are not identical on the 3V3/GPIO pins, breaking the intended pass-through."
